# tally 2.3.1 R6 (L §5.14 l.1361): a hole day with a false `when` and no `where`: the hole (b, f, n), the `when`
# read at a hole booking cut. Unchanged: a guard of the order.
=== hdfalse.tally
model hdfalse
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "probe"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place other: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input hd: date
input ok: bool

move pw: transfers
  on hd
  when ok
  leg cash from konto to other amount amt

ask b: bal(konto, 2026-06-30)
ask f: flows(pw, 2026)
ask n: count(m in transfers over 2026)

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  opening[konto] = 1 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[other] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  hd = ?"which day?" "s"
  ok = false "s"
=== expect
b: ?"which day?" (hd)
  cut 2026-04-20
f: ?"which day?" (hd)
  cut 2026-04-20
n: ?"which day?" (hd)
  cut 2026-04-20
